{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_ctrail_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_ctrail_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"迁徙前日","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"第一次正式飞行实验失败，患上矿石病后，云迹陷入了恐慌。但她害怕的究竟是什么？恐惧的原因和起飞的理由，有时同源。","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_ctrail_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["母亲","克劳迪娅","羽兽们","羽兽"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D2/Avg_bg_bg_desert_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wind","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":8},{"type":"text","text":"天气很好，能见度相当不错，风力适中。","id":9},{"type":"text","text":"短距离飞行测试已经全部完成......接下来，就是第一次正式飞行实验，预定飞行距离十公里。","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":11},{"type":"dialog","id":12},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":13},{"type":"gridbg","imagegroup":"53_g16_sunnyday_L1/53_g16_sunnyday_R1/53_g16_sunnyday_L2/53_g16_sunnyday_R2","solidwidth":"1280/1280/1280/1280","solidheight":"720/720/720/720","x":"-900","fadetime":"2","id":14},{"type":"largebgtween","duration":"30","yFrom":"300","yTo":"250","block":"false","id":15},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":16},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":17},{"type":"text","text":"比预想的还要顺利！只剩下最后两公里了，要确认好降落地点的状态。","id":18},{"type":"text","text":"顺风，速度稍微有点快，最好降下——","id":19},{"type":"text","text":"风力增强得好快？好强的上升气流——","id":20},{"type":"dialog","id":21},{"type":"playsound","key":"$blizzard","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":22},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":23},{"type":"gridbg","imagegroup":"47_g14_skyovercast_L1/47_g14_skyovercast_R1/47_g14_skyovercast_L2/47_g14_skyovercast_R2","solidwidth":"1280/1280/1280/1280","solidheight":"720/720/720/720","x":"-900","fadetime":"2","id":24},{"type":"largebgtween","duration":"30","xfrom":"-900","xto":"-800","yFrom":"300","yTo":"250","block":"false","id":25},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":26},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":27},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":28},{"type":"text","text":"云层堆积得太快了？！不，那不是普通的积雨云——","id":29},{"type":"text","text":"得马上避开！！","id":30},{"type":"text","text":"不、转向和下降都、气流——","id":31},{"type":"dialog","id":32},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":33},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":34},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":35},{"type":"gridbg","id":36},{"type":"charslot","id":37},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":38},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":39},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_heartratemonitor","volume":"0.1","loop":"true","channel":"b","id":40},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"15","id":41},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":43},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":44},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"b","fadetime":"2","id":45},{"type":"subtitle","text":"呼吸......鼻子里面......好冷......什么声音......好想关掉......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":46},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“......云......”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":47},{"type":"subtitle","text":"谁......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":48},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“......小云......迪娅......”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":49},{"type":"subtitle","text":"好困......还想睡......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":50},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“............克劳迪娅......”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":51},{"type":"subtitle","text":"妈妈......我再......睡一会儿......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":52},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":53},{"type":"subtitle","id":54},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":55},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":57},{"type":"charslot","id":58},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_bg_bg_vipward.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":59},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":60},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"b","fadetime":"2","id":61},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":62},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"今天是第四天了，小云，感觉怎么样？","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"none","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"腿还是很胀......不过，妈妈，我有事想问你。","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"你们......是不是有事瞒着我？除了骨折，我......没有别的问题吗？","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"......","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"none","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"那天，我撞上的突发强对流......还有那个云团的状态......虽然规模不算大，但那是......天灾云吧？","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"......妈妈，告诉我吧。","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"......好。克劳迪娅，你确实感染了矿石病。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"......","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"none","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"......","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"有......多严重？我还能......活多久？","id":79},{"type":"dialog","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":82},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"b","fadetime":"2","id":83},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":84},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":85},{"type":"charslot","id":86},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_bg_29_g3_cottage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":87},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":88},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":89,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":91},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"小云，你在工作间里吧？我可以进来吗？","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"你有什么事吗，妈妈？","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我不想被打扰......","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我已经没有那么多时间了......我有很多工作要做......好不容易腿好了......","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#8$2","focus":"none","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"克劳迪娅......我明白，你当然有锁上房门的权利。但昨天你答应过我，我们会好好谈一谈。","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我......一定要现在吗？我不是不想和你说话，妈妈，我只是......很忙。改天可以吗？","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#6$2","focus":"none","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"昨天，你答应了我；上周，你答应了我两次。","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"我愿意等到你觉得可以打开门的那一天......不过，今天你爸爸会回来，你知道他没法待太久，很快又得出发。","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"如果今天不行，下次你再有机会见到他，可能又是几个月之后了。","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"我们一起准备下今天的晚饭......好吗？你知道我不擅长摆弄厨房里的那些家伙......","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"回家之后，我们还没有一起吃过饭呢。","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"......","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":112},{"type":"charslot","id":113},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","duration":"2","id":115},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"嗯......你在调整燃料箱的尺寸？看起来不错。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"......不，完全不行......","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"妈妈......","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我......好累。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":123},{"type":"charslot","id":124},{"type":"text","text":"克劳迪娅坐在一个木箱上，母亲走到了她身边，克劳迪娅没有放下手上的工具，只是把额头抵在了妈妈的肚子上。","id":125},{"type":"text","text":"熟悉的毛衣，熟悉的触感，熟悉的洗涤剂味道。可为什么，一切都像是变了......","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我知道......我把自己关在工作间里，你们一定很担心......","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"可不这么做，我就，我就完全没办法平静。","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"......即使这样做了，我也没办法平静。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":131},{"type":"charslot","id":132},{"type":"text","text":"母亲没有说话，只是轻轻地把手放在了克劳迪娅的毛线帽上，手掌的边缘蹭过了克劳迪娅的耳朵，是温热的。","id":133},{"type":"dialog","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#6$2","duration":"1.5","id":135},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":136},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#6$2","focus":"l","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我好害怕，妈妈......","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"没关系的，小云，我们知道这件事对你打击很大......无论你是想尝试别的道路，还是想再试试，努力克服对飞行的恐惧......","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"不，妈妈。我不是害怕飞行......","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#6$2","focus":"l","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我是怕......我是怕死。","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"你知道我一直想做的那件事......","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"......一次完整的羽兽迁徙伴飞？","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#2$2","focus":"l","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"嗯。从哥伦比亚到雷姆必拓，再从雷姆必拓回到哥伦比亚......","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"虽然现在，整片大地连一张足够完整精确的羽兽迁徙地图都还没有人画出来过。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我一直以为，如果一生只为这一件事努力，也许最后我会有机会做到......","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"可是我的一生......为什么会突然变得这么短呢？","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"......","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"......医生说，你的感染并不算严重......矿石病......矿石病......说不定再过几年，矿石病就能......","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":158},{"type":"charslot","id":159},{"type":"text","text":"克劳迪娅没有忽略母亲不自然的停顿。她明白，即使是想要安慰她，身为科学工作者的母亲也无法说出那近乎妄想的陈述。","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#6$2","focus":"l","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"......妈妈，我只是想要时间，稍微......足够的时间。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"可为什么连仅有的这点时间......我也不能有？","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#8$2","focus":"l","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"......","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我还是继续调整飞行器吧。燃料箱也好，结构架也好，引擎也好，喷气口也好，总归会有点用......总归......","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"不对，燃料箱这样弄还是不对，我要拆下来再重做一遍......","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"......今天先休息一晚，好不好？我真的很不会做饭，我们总不能让爸爸回来吃罐头吧？","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"none","id":172},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_transmissionget","id":173},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"是他的消息，算算时间也差不多了......嗯？","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"......小云，你爸爸说，他捡到了一窝快孵化的羽兽蛋，但是母羽受伤很重，没能救回来。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"我猜......他会把它们带回来。","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":181},{"type":"charslot","id":182},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9B/Avg_bg_33_g8_srcroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":184},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":185},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"这样......应该差不多？","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"嗯，用这些灯泡作为热源，然后是垫料......唔，再加一层吧。我那条围巾放在哪儿了，小云你记得吗......","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我觉得用毛巾也行，我拿两条毛巾过来。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"1.5","id":196},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":197},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.6","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":201},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"嗯......铺好了。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"不知道还来不来得及......","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"应该还行？毕竟你爸爸一路都把它们捂在肚皮上。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"不过......我的截稿日快到了。看这些蛋的情况，可能这一两天就要破壳了，小云，你能照顾它们吗？","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#5$2","focus":"l","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"欸？可、可以呀，既然妈妈要忙的话......","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":211},{"type":"charslot","id":212},{"type":"text","text":"克劳迪娅趴在简易孵化箱的边缘。热灯泡的光暖烘烘地照在白色的蛋壳上，反光亮得有点刺眼，可她目不转睛地盯着。","id":213},{"type":"text","text":"也许是错觉，她好像听到了轻微的摩擦声，像是某一张小小的喙抬了起来，蹭到了内壳......","id":214},{"type":"dialog","id":215},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#6$2","focus":"l","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"......你们真能活下来吗......","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":219},{"type":"charslot","id":220},{"type":"text","text":"她说得很小声。","id":221},{"type":"text","text":"她希望妈妈没有听见这句话。","id":222},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":224},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":226},{"type":"charslot","id":227},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_bg_31_g3_mini12_farmland.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":228},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":229},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":230,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":231},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":232},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","duration":"2","id":234},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"嘿，该出门了，你们需要晒太阳，明白吗？","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","focus":"none","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"羽兽们","text":"（嘈杂的啁啾）","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"不然你们的骨头和羽毛就不能变硬变坚固，那可是很危险的！","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#8$2","focus":"none","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"羽兽们","text":"（吵闹的啁啾）","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"好吧，好吧，现在跟着我......","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":245},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":246},{"type":"charslot","duration":"2","id":247},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":248},{"type":"text","text":"克劳迪娅在田野里快步走着，每走几步就要回头看一眼。小羽兽们扑棱着翅膀跟着她，自然而然地列成了一队。","id":249},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"没错，没错，就像这样。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"现在的太阳正好，如果阳光太烈了也不行，你们会脱水的......","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","focus":"none","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"羽兽们","text":"（好奇的啁啾）","id":254},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"喂！别去那边，我前几天在那里看到了流浪云兽！","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"这里这里这里，过来过来过来——","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":258},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"1.5","id":261},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":262},{"type":"charslot","id":263},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","id":264},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"噢——","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"妈妈！","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":270},{"type":"charslot","id":271},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.6","id":272},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,-50","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":274},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"我没事。","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"印随行为......","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"嗯，它们把我当成它们的妈妈了。","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"我记得......以前是不是也发生过？","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"那时候你还很小......自己就像一只雏羽，可屁股后面还跟着两只小羽兽。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"嗯，八岁的时候，你和爸爸带我去雷姆必拓的那一次......","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"那次捡到羽兽蛋的是我。我本来想学着像羽兽那样孵蛋，是妈妈你教我搭了孵化箱......","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我还记得我们的帐篷裂了一条口子，爸爸补帐篷的时候让我帮忙......","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我在帐篷里面把裂口的地方拉住，那两只小羽兽趁我动不了，顺着我的胳膊跳上来，从裂口钻出去了......","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"然后你就在帐篷里尖叫起来，把爸爸吓坏了，哈哈。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我怕它们跑到外面会出事嘛......","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"结果我一跑出帐篷，它们就扑腾着冲我跑来了。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"呵呵......就和现在差不多呢。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"......嗯。","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"小云......","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"怎么了，妈妈？","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"没什么，我和你一起陪它们晒晒太阳吧。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"啊！是不是你的文章写完啦？那要庆祝一下，晚饭多做个菜吗？","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":306},{"type":"charslot","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"羽兽们","text":"（兴奋的啁啾）","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"呃，还没有......好了！有编辑催我就足够了，小云你就别问了。还有你们，你们也不许问！","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"我就不能出来散散步嘛......","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"噗......好哦，妈妈。","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A5/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":314},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":315},{"type":"charslot","duration":"2","id":316},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":317},{"type":"text","text":"夕阳的光线渐渐橙红，她们走在羽兽的啁啾之中。","id":318},{"type":"text","text":"女人牵着女儿的手，她很想问克劳迪娅一些问题，但又有点不敢问。","id":319},{"type":"text","text":"她担心她只是一时之间忘了，她担心自己会让这个孩子又想起来。","id":320},{"type":"text","text":"有些疑问一旦在心中滋生，就再也挥之不去，她明白这一点。","id":321},{"type":"text","text":"如果可以，她会希望她的女儿永远不需要面对人生的这一面......尤其不必以这样的方式。","id":322},{"type":"text","text":"克劳迪娅突然换了一只手牵住母亲，她倒着走，这样就可以时刻盯着小羽兽们的每一步。","id":323},{"type":"dialog","id":324},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","duration":"1.5","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":326},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":327},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"克劳迪娅。","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#5$2","focus":"l","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"妈妈？","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"你了解这种羽兽的生活史吗？","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","focus":"l","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"嗯，大概知道，前几天我又查了一些细节。","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"破壳之后大约两到三周，它们就有了飞行的能力和生理冲动；最晚到第四周......","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","focus":"l","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"嗯。我知道，妈妈。","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"你打算......不，没事，没什么。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"我们家照顾这窝羽兽肯定没问题。无论怎么样，它们都可以好好过完这一生。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"妈妈，你是想说，它们不用飞起来也可以吗？","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"......","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#6$2","focus":"l","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"那你又为什么要向我提起这件事呢......","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"......克劳迪娅，我最近才明白......","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"不，我以为我早就明白，但最近我才真正体会到，同一种东西对不同的人来说，可能会多么地不一样......","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"我都不知道我竟然会这么......小心翼翼。","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"我竟然会这么害怕......害怕一句话，一种我从来都觉得无害的话。","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"“振作起来”......那会成为又一个负担吗？","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"......","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"我有时觉得我是被一些不理智的情感支配了，是激素或者神经作用，是极端情形中的应激反应，是触发了特定条件下的行为模式......","id":356,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"但无论怎么解释——","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"我唯独做不到，想象你再受一点点痛苦。","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"妈妈很没用吧。明明受到伤害的人是你。","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"......","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"对不起，抱歉，克劳迪娅，别安慰我。不该是你安慰我。","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"我们再走走吧，我很久没这样散步了。","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":365},{"type":"charslot","id":366},{"type":"text","text":"克劳迪娅只是默默牵住了母亲的手。","id":367},{"type":"text","text":"那会是痛苦吗......？但她没来得及继续想下去——","id":368},{"type":"text","text":"两只小羽兽挨到她近处，一只用力挤向另一只，被挤的那一只惊得差点钻到克劳迪娅的脚下，克劳迪娅连忙抬起脚，单腿跳了几步。","id":369},{"type":"text","text":"差点被踩到的小羽兽扑腾了几下翅膀，也许它是在模仿抬起脚的克劳迪娅？","id":370},{"type":"text","text":"有一个瞬间，克劳迪娅以为它要飞起来了——","id":371},{"type":"text","text":"但并没有，扑扇了几下翅膀后，它还是像之前那样蹦跶着，想要去蹭克劳迪娅的脚踝。","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"羽兽","text":"（依赖的啁啾）","id":373},{"type":"dialog","id":374},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","duration":"1.5","id":375},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":376},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"......","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":379},{"type":"charslot","id":380},{"type":"text","text":"克劳迪娅松开母亲的手，弯腰把它捧了起来。","id":381},{"type":"text","text":"也许是因为视野高度突然改变，雏羽有些瑟缩，克劳迪娅感觉到手里热热的一团羽毛在发抖。","id":382},{"type":"text","text":"但它终究还是探出了头，向左瞧瞧，向右瞧瞧，然后......","id":383},{"type":"text","text":"它是在看天空吗？克劳迪娅想。","id":384},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"妈妈。","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":387},{"type":"charslot","id":388},{"type":"text","text":"她仍然看着手中的羽兽。","id":389},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"也许我会痛苦吧......毕竟......各种各样的事都会发生。","id":391,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"但我并不害怕飞行。","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"不论发生什么，我是不会害怕飞行的。","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A5/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":396},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":397},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":398},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":399},{"type":"charslot","id":400},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_bg_29_g3_cottage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":401},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":402},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","text":"","id":403,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":404},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":405},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fixcarjingle","id":406},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":407},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"锤子呢......啊，我干嘛焊那么紧......","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FB/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":410},{"type":"charslot","id":411},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","duration":"2","id":413},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"......","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"或者凿子......欸，妈妈？","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"你没有关门......所以我就......","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"嗯......没事，应该要不了多久就能搞定。会吵到你吗？","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"当然不会......不过，你好像有阵子没来这里了？","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"前阵子在忙嘛......毕竟它们都跟着我，我要是总待在工作间，它们就晒不够太阳了。","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"那今天......？","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"做点准备。","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"妈妈上次也提到了吧。我这几天又挨个检查了一遍，飞羽都已经长得差不多了。算算时间，已经有点晚了。","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":431},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"呃，虽然爬到树上把它们一只只往下扔......说不定也行......不行，我觉得不行，太危险了！","id":432,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"总而言之......我需要我的飞行器。","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"之前把飞行器都改得乱七八糟了......其实有用的改装没多少，还得敲掉或者改回原样。","id":435,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我现在需要的，是一台经过测试的、能够稳定起飞的飞行器。","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"这样就好。","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A5/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"......嗯。我能帮上忙吗？","id":440,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"如果你知道我把锤子放在哪里了的话......","id":442,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"嗯哼，我确实知道。","id":444,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":445},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":446},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":447},{"type":"charslot","id":448},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E4/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_m.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":449},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":450},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":451},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":452},{"type":"text","text":"天气很好。虽然还有一点晨雾残留，但很快就会在逐渐明亮的阳光中散去。","id":453},{"type":"text","text":"有微风。克劳迪娅抓起一把草叶，松手；草叶落下，风向东南。","id":454},{"type":"text","text":"羽兽们叽叽喳喳地跟在她身后。它们的“妈妈”今天看起来有点不一样......","id":455},{"type":"text","text":"但这并不妨碍它们同往常一样，亦步亦趋、挨挨挤挤地跟在她身后。","id":456},{"type":"text","text":"然后她停了下来，面朝着它们。克劳迪娅让妈妈留在了远处，但在开始之前，她觉得自己想要......说点什么。","id":457},{"type":"text","text":"羽兽们当然听不懂，但......","id":458},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":459},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"嘿，听我说......","id":460,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我们今天要，学习飞行。","id":461,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":462},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"其实我也在想，就算没有我，也许你们也会模仿别的羽兽，或者凭着自己天生的冲动展开双翼。","id":463,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"就算没有成年羽兽带领你们，你们终究......是会飞起来的。","id":464,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6C/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"等你们能够飞起来，不久之后，你们还要学会迁徙。我会带你们到已知的、你们族群迁徙路线上的途经点。","id":466,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"理想的状况当然是，当找到属于你们的羽兽群时，你们已经能够自如地飞行了，这样你们就能跟上它们......","id":468,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":469},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"其实我很想陪着你们完成迁徙。一次完整的、历时三年的迁徙。一直以来......一直以来，这都是我最大的愿望。","id":470,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"但现在我做不到......","id":471,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":472},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"......","id":473,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":474},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"不说这些了。今天你们，我们只需要......飞起来。","id":475,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":476},{"type":"charslot","id":477},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wind","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":478},{"type":"text","text":"克劳迪娅能感觉到阳光照射的角度在慢慢升高，空气和她身体表面的温度也一同缓缓上升。","id":479},{"type":"text","text":"清晨的风穿过胁下，她开始助跑，像是要乘到空气之上。","id":480},{"type":"text","text":"她启动了飞行器。","id":481},{"type":"text","text":"大地向下、向后，缓慢而平稳地离去。","id":482},{"type":"text","text":"她听到身后扑翼的声音，比她想象中的还要响亮，啁啾声变成了鸣叫，在抬升着她的气流中振动，她能听见这一切。","id":483},{"type":"dialog","id":484},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":485},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":486},{"type":"gridbg","imagegroup":"53_g16_sunnyday_L1/53_g16_sunnyday_R1/53_g16_sunnyday_L2/53_g16_sunnyday_R2","solidwidth":"1280/1280/1280/1280","solidheight":"720/720/720/720","x":"-900","fadetime":"2","id":487},{"type":"largebgtween","duration":"30","yFrom":"300","yTo":"250","block":"false","id":488},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":489},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":490},{"type":"text","text":"越来越高，越来越高。","id":491},{"type":"text","text":"调整喷气角度，左倾，右倾，她知道自己画出了流畅的曲线。","id":492},{"type":"text","text":"身后飞翔的羽兽把轨迹缀成了一条点状线。","id":493},{"type":"text","text":"很多事情都远去了，和大地上逐渐变小的事物一起。","id":494},{"type":"text","text":"她只是享受着风，就和第一次投入天空一样。","id":495},{"type":"text","text":"穿过云的影子时，那个幽灵般的问题也像影子一样俯身而来。","id":496},{"type":"text","text":"“尽管如此，尽管如此，你还能像这样飞多久......？”","id":497},{"type":"text","text":"“你能抵达终点吗？”","id":498},{"type":"text","text":"可是太奇怪了。","id":499},{"type":"text","text":"在空气和羽兽啼鸣的围拥中，这些之前压得她喘不过气的问题好像，变得轻了......","id":500},{"type":"text","text":"只要一声心跳就可以震落。","id":501},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我在想什么呢......","id":502},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"就算是之前，难道我就知道一定能完成吗......","id":503},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"明明一直都是这样的......一直都是这样的啊。","id":504},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我只是想要......飞起来而已。","id":505},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"就算飞不到雷姆必拓，能越过拉特兰也可以，能抵达维多利亚也可以......","id":506},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"就算飞不到汐斯塔，能到谢拉格也可以，能飞出哥伦比亚也可以......","id":507},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"路线图也是一段一段画出来的。","id":508},{"type":"text","text":"又是一声啼鸣破开风声。","id":509},{"type":"text","text":"克劳迪娅决定把那当作赞同。","id":510},{"type":"dialog","id":511},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":512},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":513},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":514},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":515},{"type":"charslot","id":516},{"type":"gridbg","id":517},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_bg_31_g3_mini12_farmland.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":518},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":519},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":520,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":521},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":522},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":523},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"妈妈，我有事想和你说。","id":524,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":525},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"什么事，宝贝？","id":526,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":527},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"你知道罗德岛吗？","id":528,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我最近查了一下，他们有一类治疗项目......我觉得，也许我可以申请。","id":529,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":530},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"小云......","id":531,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":532},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"我还查了一下相关新闻......看起来，罗德岛本舰会进行跨国航行，说不定我能借这个机会，调查大地上不同区域的羽兽迁徙情况。","id":533,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AC/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":534},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克劳迪娅","text":"你觉得呢，妈妈？","id":535,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A5/Avg_avg_4165_ctrail_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_524_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":536},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"......好啊。不过，要让我看看这个治疗项目的探访条款，你不介意我偶尔去蹭个车吧？","id":537,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_524_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":538},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":539},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":540},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4165_ctrail_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":541},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":542},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.6","id":543},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":544},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"1.5","id":545},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":546},{"type":"text","text":"克劳迪娅抱住了母亲。","id":547},{"type":"text","text":"熟悉的毛衣，熟悉的触感，熟悉的洗涤剂味道。","id":548},{"type":"text","text":"是啊，有些事情发生了一点点变化。","id":549},{"type":"text","text":"但有些事情是不会变的，克劳迪娅想。","id":550},{"type":"dialog","id":551},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":552},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":553},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":554},{"type":"image","id":555},{"type":"charslot","id":556}],"characters":["母亲","克劳迪娅","羽兽们","羽兽"]}